# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every .env is ignored; the committed *.example files are the documented
# template. Never relax this — a leaked service-role key gives full DB access.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example
backend/github-app.pem
*.pem
*.key
!**/testdata/**/*.pem

# ── Build / tooling output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
backend/tmp/
backend/.supabase/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/
.turbo/
.next/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Generated verification artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The audit probe writes a per-surface ledger (census, flags, tab order, one
# JSONL row per control) on every sweep — ~90 files that are re-derived by
# `playwright test e2e/audit/probe.spec.ts`. The instrument is source and IS
# committed; its output is not.
frontend/e2e/audit/ledger/
# Repos cloned by `npm run truth` to diff the pipeline against hand-labeled
# expectations. The fixtures in backend/test/truth/*.json are source; the
# clones are just checkouts and are re-fetched on demand.
backend/.truth-repos/

# ── Editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cursor/
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ── Local-only docs and scratch harnesses ────────────────────────────────────
# Throwaway UI preview harness (see frontend-ui-preview-harness memory)
frontend/preview.html
frontend/src/preview.tsx
frontend/hybrid.html
frontend/src/hybrid/

doc/Feedback.md
doc/PLAN.md
doc/Team*.md
doc/Design.md

# ── Test-runner output (root) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Playwright writes here when invoked from the repo root rather than frontend/.
# Re-derived by any test run; never review it in a diff.
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ── Live-verification probes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `backend/tmp/` (ignored above) is where every throwaway DB/HTTP probe written
# this session lives — smoke.mts, census.mts, extract.mts, journeys.mts, the
# qfix-*/nest* measurement scripts. They are deliberately NOT committed: they
# hardcode snapshot ids and throwaway credentials, and they are rewritten for
# whatever is being measured that day. The DURABLE instruments are committed
# and live in backend/scripts/ (truth-diff, explanation-diff, role-census).

# Repos cloned by measurement harnesses at snapshot SHAs.
/tmp/obb-fleet/
backend/.probe-tmp/

# ── Deliberately COMMITTED — do not add ignores for these ────────────────────
# Recorded because each looks ignorable and is not:
#   doc/AUDIT_LEDGER.md, CONTENT_AUDIT.md, OWNER_FEEDBACK_M4.md,
#   READER_REDESIGN.md, TUTORIAL_REDESIGN.md, VISUAL_QA_M4.md,
#   ROLE_DIFFERENTIATION_PLAN.md, PROJECT_SCORECARD.md
#     -> the findings/goals corpus the rework is graded against.
#   doc/reader-audit/, doc/visual-qa-m4-shots/  (~2.4 MB, 23 images)
#     -> the audit docs cite these by filename as evidence; a dangling
#        reference is worse than the bytes.
#   backend/test/truth/*.json, backend/test/golden/*.json
#     -> hand-labeled expectations; the accuracy gate is meaningless without them.
#   backend/src/worker/fixtures/**  (incl. pureLibrary/, pureCli/, nested/,
#     mixed/deploy/secrets.yml)
#     -> parser fixtures. The "secrets" file is FAKE, on purpose: it is the
#        hostile input the secret-scanner test asserts against.
#   *.example env templates -> the documented setup contract.

# ── Working docs: ours, not the reader's ─────────────────────────────────────
# doc/ is for the TA and teammates. Audits, scorecards, owner-feedback logs and
# redesign specs are the working notes behind the rework — they stay on disk and
# the task list still points at them, they just are not part of what someone
# reviewing this project should have to wade through.
doc/AUDIT_LEDGER.md
doc/CONTENT_AUDIT.md
doc/OWNER_FEEDBACK_M4.md
doc/VISUAL_QA_M4.md
doc/UX_AUDIT_FINDINGS.md
doc/UX_VISUAL_AUDIT.md
doc/PROJECT_SCORECARD.md
doc/ONBOARDING_UX_VALIDATION.md
doc/ONBOARDING_FIX_IMPLEMENTATION.md
doc/REWORK_PLAN.md
doc/ROLE_DIFFERENTIATION_PLAN.md
doc/READER_REDESIGN.md
doc/TUTORIAL_REDESIGN.md
doc/reader-audit/
doc/visual-qa-m4-shots/
